				<title>SCP-5127</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5127</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5127&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Euclid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; scp-5127 is being contained at site-06-3 until the foreseeable future. No personnel should stand within 5 meters of scp-5127 this is due to its anomaly. No special amenities are to be given to scp-5127.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; scp-5127 is an anomalous object that resembles a wax figure of an unknown origin. scp-5127 seems to be completely inanimate until it is approached by any living subject in 5 meters. If a living being enters the 5 meters seclusion zone scp-5127 will become semi-conscious and will not return to its inanimate state until it neutralises the subject. attempts to interview scp-5127 during its semi-conscious state but these attempts failed. All testing has been suspended.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/james677777777&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7084384&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607008363&quot; alt=&quot;James677777777&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7084384)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/james677777777&quot;  &gt;James677777777&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
