					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-5127</p> <p><strong>Object Class:</strong> Euclid</p> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> scp-5127 is being contained at site-06-3 until the foreseeable future. No personnel should stand within 5 meters of scp-5127 this is due to its anomaly. No special amenities are to be given to scp-5127.</p> <p><strong>Description:</strong> scp-5127 is an anomalous object that resembles a wax figure of an unknown origin. scp-5127 seems to be completely inanimate until it is approached by any living subject in 5 meters. If a living being enters the 5 meters seclusion zone scp-5127 will become semi-conscious and will not return to its inanimate state until it neutralises the subject. attempts to interview scp-5127 during its semi-conscious state but these attempts failed. All testing has been suspended.</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/james677777777" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7084384&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607008363" alt="James677777777" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7084384)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/james677777777" >James677777777</a></span></p> 
