				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5133</guid>
				<title>SCP-5133</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5133</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5133&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Keter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5133 is to be kept in a 5 x 5 x 2.5 cell suspended in a vacuum via electromagnets. It is to be monitored via a wireless camera at all times.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the event of a containment breach, special tranquillisers are to be used against it as they have shown effective in temporarily neutralising it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5133 is a Caucasian human female of average weight and size and unknown age, though it claims to be ███ years old.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5133 is able to create portals at will, via a ball of energy with approximately a 15cm radius that travels at ████ km/h known as SCP-5133-1, which can travel infinitely in a straight line as long as there is matter in its path until it reaches it&#039;s destination, where it turns into an instance of SCP-5133-2 and creates another instance of SCP-5133-2 at SCP-5133&#039;s Current destination&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5133-2 is a portal which if walked through by SCP-5133 it instantly transports it to its corresponding twin portal created at the same time. They are attached via a pocket dimension where time is stopped (See Interview-5133-A). Walking through the portal by other subjects has resulted in coming out of the other side of the same portal they walked in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5133 has shown no signs of ageing since it was originally contained on ██/██/20██ and general compliance with containment, but will occasionally enter a rage state for unknown reasons, going into a portal, disappearing and reappearing with a blade that expunges solids and liquids from existence (SCP-5133-3). attempts to break SCP-5133-3 have been so far unsuccessful due to its nature and its handle has shown indestructible. Also, If SCP-5133 is knocked unconscious, SCP-5133-3 will teleport into a portal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Interview-5133-A&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Log, ██:██&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Okay, This is Dr. ██████ with interview-5133-A of SCP-5133&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5133:&lt;/strong&gt; Please, Call me █████.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; I am afraid I have to call you SCP-5133.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5133:&lt;/strong&gt; Okay then.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; When did your abilities first manifest?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5133:&lt;/strong&gt; When I was ██ I think. it was about ███ years ago so my memory has gone a bit fuzzy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Ok, Where did you find SCP-5133-3?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5133:&lt;/strong&gt; Where did I find what?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Your sword.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5133:&lt;/strong&gt; Oh that old thing. I found it about ███ years ago, while travelling through a portal and it was just there. It had not been there before but then it was there, out of nowhere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Thank you. How do you create the portals?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5133:&lt;/strong&gt; I am not fully sure myself, I usually think of where i want to go and one appears but sometimes one appears without me thinking about it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Thank you. I think we are done here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Log, ██:██&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closing Statement:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr. ██████ left the room and SCP-5133 was successfully returned to containment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footer-wikiwalk-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
