						 <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong>« <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/uau102020">October 2020</a> | <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/uau112020">November 2020</a></span> | <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/uau122020">December 2020</a> »</strong></p> </div> <hr /> <div class="feature-block"> <div class="content-panel left-column"> <div class="panel-heading"> <p>Featured SCP!</p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <h3><span><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5448">SCP-5448</a>: When We Fall Asleep, Where Do We Go?</span></h3> <p><em>It is a beauty, isn't it?</em><br /> <br /> <br /></p> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p>Featured SCP.</p> </div> </div> <div class="content-panel right-column"> <div class="panel-heading"> <p>Featured Tale/Format!</p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <h3><span><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-bowels-of-history">The Bowels of History</a></span></h3> <p><em>Meat can be made to resemble the future. The future and past are words used to describe the way something looks. Time is a synonym for meat.</em><br /></p> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p>Featured non-SCP.</p> </div> </div> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h1><span>Topic and Prompt of the month!</span></h1> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><span style="font-size:150%;"><a clas