n</a></span>.</li> </ul> <h4><span>GoI Formats</span></h4> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/iron-priest-aic-fep26-pr4y5-m3k43">'Iron-Priest.aic' (FEP26/PR4Y5/M3K43)</a> [Marshall, Carter &amp; Dark, Ltd.] - &quot;<em>So I've been talking to one of the Maxwellist higher-ups, and I've heard they are having problems with people losing their faith. So I made a deal with those Maxwellists, and they agreed to supply us with their tech, while we supply them with an AI of ours that can help them out with this little problem of theirs.</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/basirskipreader" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6657366&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607008365" alt="basirskipreader" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6657366)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/basirskipreader" >basirskipreader</a></span>.</li> </ul> <h4><span>Misc</span></h4> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/ananomalouswriter-s-wallpaper-place-and-more">AnAnomalousWriter's Wallpaper Place (and more)</a> - Wallpapers bring more life to your office, more colors and more joy, so don't hesitate to use it! <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ananomalouswriter" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5184766&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607008365" alt="AnAnomalousWriter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5184766)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ananomalouswriter" >AnAnomalousWriter</a></span> have some in stock.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/croq-workbench">Croquembouche's Workbench</a> - Croq' do his Mod things on this one. Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/croquembouche" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2893766&amp;amp;